const baseCloseUber=closeUberShift;closeUberShift=function(){let a=activeShift(),tr=activeTrips();if(!a)return;let prev=[...(state.uberTurns||[])].sort((x,y)=>String(y.end).localeCompare(String(x.end)))[0];modal(`<div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Fin</label><input id="en" type="datetime-local" value="${new Date().toISOString().slice(0,16)}"></div><div class="field"><label>Km tablero final</label><input id="o" type="number" step="0.1"></div><div class="field"><label>Propinas / otros</label><input id="tips" type="number" value="0"></div></div><div class="notice">Km fuera de Uber desde el turno anterior: <b>${prev&&a.odo1>=prev.odo2?num(a.odo1-prev.odo2):'—'}</b>. El ingreso que pasa a Ingresos será bruto − bencina cargada.</div><button class="btn" id="s">Finalizar jornada</button>`,b=>$('#s',b).onclick=()=>{let en=$('#en',b).value,o2=+$('#o',b).value||0;if(!en||o2<a.odo1)return alert('Revisa hora final y kilometraje');let hours=(new Date(en)-new Date(a.start))/36e5,km=o2-a.odo1,tips=+$('#tips',b).value||0,gross=tr.reduce((x,t)=>x+t.amount,0)+tips,s=state.uberSettings,fuel=s.efficiency>0?km/s.efficiency*s.fuelPrice:0,wear=km*s.wearKm,ret=gross*s.retention/100,net=gross-fuel-wear-ret,cashSurplus=gross-(+a.fuelLoad||0),outsideKm=prev&&a.odo1>=prev.odo2?a.odo1-prev.odo2:0,ww=state.wallets.find(x=>x.id===a.wallet),incomeId='uberinc_'+a.id;state.uberTurns.push({id:a.id,start:a.start,end:en,odo1:a.odo1,odo2:o2,km,outsideKm,hours,gross,tips,fuelLoad:+a.fuelLoad||0,fuelCost:fuel,wear,retention:ret,net,cashSurplus,wallet:a.wallet,tripCount:tr.length,incomeId});if(cashSurplus>0){state.incomes.push({id:incomeId,date:en.slice(0,10),source:'Uber',amount:cashSurplus,wallet:a.wallet,note:'Jornada Uber '+a.id});if(ww)ww.balance+=cashSurplus}state.uberActiveShift=null;save(`Jornada cerrada · ingreso ${fmt(cashSurplus)}`);b.remove();render()})}
